        "content": "<p>Is there a theorem in Mathlib that states <code>a ≡ b [MOD p] ∧ a ≡ b [MOD q] ↔ a ≡ b [MOD p.lcm q]</code> or anything equivalent? I tried to loogle it but found nothing.</p>",
